rt. We may retain data required for transaction records, legal obligations, fraud prevention, or dispute resolution.</p></section><section><h2>7. Updates and contact</h2><p>We may update this notice when our practices or legal obligations change. Contact Foodera through the site for privacy questions or requests.</p></section></article></main>
